2. Confirm `pnpm vitest run` → 692/692 GREEN baseline (or document deviation).
3. Read the input Zod schema of any router procedure that .whatsnext claims will be
   reused — catches scope mismatches BEFORE the BUILD BATCH PROPOSAL stage (Batch 12 lesson).
